    "title": "BBS & TGP",
    "description": "Need a haircut?  Making your next appointment just got easier.  At The Barbershop and The Guys' Place we want you to enjoy your haircut again.  Use our app to quickly schedule your next haircut.  All you have to do is create an account, pick your location and selecting the service and time.  You can also choose your favorite stylist or barber.   Don't worry, creating your account is easy.  Once you have an account you can use our app to see your appointment history and track your personal preferences including which stylist or barber previously cut your hair and what other services you have received.   Getting your haircut shouldn't be hard.  Let our app make your life easier.  Download the app today and enjoy your haircut again.",
